## 🧾 Commit & QA Standards

- Commit format: `<type>: <subject>`  
  - Types: feat, fix, docs, style, refactor, test, chore
- Run before PR:
  - `npm run lint`
  - `tsc --noEmit` (type check)
- Keep secrets (`NEXTAUTH_SECRET`, DB URLs) in server env only.

---

## 🧩 Page CSS Rules (.module.scss + kebab-case)

### Main Pages
- Wrapper: `.main-wrapper`
- Section: `<section>` with `.sec01`, `.sec02`, etc.
- Use section-based naming: `.sec01-banner`, `.sec01-img-area`, etc.

### Sub Pages
- Wrapper: `.list-wrapper`, `.mypage-wrapper`, `.detail-wrapper`
- Prefix classes with page key: `.list-filter-area`, `.detail-info-box`
- Hierarchy: `wrapper > area > box`

### Responsive Mixins
- Use from `src/styles/_mixins.scss`
@include pc { ... }
@include tablet { ... }
@include mobile { ... }

